1
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:07,100
<i>Long ago, the legend says,</i>
很久以前，传说

2
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,354
<i>Chang’e flew to the Moon.</i>
嫦娥飞上了月亮。

3
00:00:08,394 --> 00:00:10,066
<i>Unable to return home.</i>
回不了家。

4
00:00:10,336 --> 00:00:11,676
<i>In 726, Li Bai looked up at the Moon</i>
公元726年，李白举头望月，

5
00:00:11,716 --> 00:00:13,080
<i>and wrote about missing home.</i>
写下了对故乡的思念。

6
00:00:17,789 --> 00:00:19,119
<i>Every space program on Earth</i>
全世界的航天计划

7
00:00:19,159 --> 00:00:21,266
<i>is building the International Moonbase.</i>
共建国际月球基地。

8
00:00:32,141 --> 00:00:35,110
The willow in winter is slender,
冬柳身纤细，

9
00:00:35,846 --> 00:00:38,550
her switches plain and straight;
丝素净笔直；

10
00:00:39,531 --> 00:00:42,560
the West Lake wind sings over water,
西湖的风掠过水面歌唱，

11
00:00:43,155 --> 00:00:46,280
like smoothing silk, and late
如抚平丝绸；午后将晚，

12
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:50,280
in afternoon teahouses watching
在茶馆里，看着

13
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:54,030
snow-brewed tea. That line—
雪水烹茶。那一句——

14
00:00:54,090 --> 00:00:55,887
举杯邀明月，
I raise my cup to invite the bright moon;

15
00:00:55,927 --> 00:00:57,809
对影成三人
with my shadow, we make three.

16
00:00:57,849 --> 00:01:05,000
I think of you — homesick with waning
我想你——思乡，伴着残月

17
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:11,490
moons and lonely wine.
与孤独的酒。

18
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:21,424
月缺酒寒，
The moon wanes, the wine grows cold —

19
00:01:21,464 --> 00:01:26,460
我思念你
I miss you.

20
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:30,850
I think of you, I think of you
我想你，我想你

21
00:01:32,213 --> 00:01:34,860
举杯邀明月
I raise my cup to invite the bright moon

22
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:38,750
moons and lonely wine
残月与孤酒

23
00:01:51,950 --> 00:01:55,526
举头望明月，
I raise my head to gaze at the bright moon

24
00:01:55,566 --> 00:02:02,900
低头思故乡
I lower my head and think of home.

25
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:24,480
海上生明月，
<i>The bright moon rises over the sea;</i>

26
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:30,060
天涯共此时
<i>however far apart, we share this moment.</i>

27
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:32,037
<i>For everyone working far from</i>
献给每一位在远方工作、

28
00:03:32,077 --> 00:03:34,003
<i>the people they love. Look up —</i>
思念家人的人。抬头看看——

29
00:03:34,043 --> 00:03:36,000
<i>they’re looking at the same moon.</i>
他们望着的，是同一轮明月。
